rooms_desc ({"You have entered the foyer area in the lovely home of Talos.On the east wall there are coat racks and to the west is an area in orderto place your footwear. There is also a welcome mat in the doorway.To the north you can continue on into the entrance hall.","This is the entrance hall, guests are greeted after they accept the invitation to enter Talos' home.  Various servants are here to attend to anyone's needs.  To the east is the living area of the grand home and tothe west, a person may enter the dining area.  Further to the northis a grand ballroom, where many lavish events have been held.You have a feeling that this is more of a small castle than a home.","You have entered into the Grand Ballroom.  The walls shimmer withgold and silver. An immense chandelier is held high above thechamber illuminating the entire area.  You can tell that many greatfunctions have been held in this room.  Maybe there will even be one tonight?  A large set of stairs curve up along the walls to the secondfloor, where the living quarters of Talos may be found.","You have now entered the living area.  A warm glow is emanating from thehearth in the east wall.  There are several chairs and rockers withinthe room in order to kick back and relax, after long days of adventuring.  A small bar occupies the northern side of the roomand the southern portion is being used for various gaming tables.You feel very relaxed, and are able to rest at ease in this room.To the west you may head back to the entrance hall.","You have entered the dining area.  Amazingly, it seems that all the places have already been set for you and are awaiting you to feast.Your mouth begins to water as you see the wide selection of foodsthat are strewn across the table.  Perhaps you should take a seat?","This is the final room in Talos' abode...the bedroom. As you can plainlysee...it has had very little use, i wonder why?=)",0,0,0,0,})
